cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this report, its data or its figures, please cite it as below."
title: "Fonts on the Web in 2026"
authors:
  - family-names: Berret
    given-names: Charles
date-released: 2026-10-23
version: "draft v10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/charlesberret/fonts-2026-analysis"
abstract: >-
  A study of how fonts are hosted, packaged, loaded and designed across the web, read from the
  HTTP Archive crawl of 1 July 2026 (11.6 million desktop and 15.5 million mobile root pages) and
  compared with the Web Almanac Fonts chapters of 2019 to 2025. Commissioned by Google Fonts.
keywords:
  - web fonts
  - HTTP Archive
  - Web Almanac
  - typography
  - WOFF2
  - variable fonts
  - Incremental Font Transfer
